-- 4. Drift — strip lead/bell/arp, keep pads, texture and slow bass

fadeSilence 16 [4,5,6,9]

xfadeIn 3 16 $ highPad # gain 0.74 # lpf 1200

xfadeIn 7 16 $ noiseBed # gain 0.66 # lpf 900

xfadeIn 8 16 $ bassLong # gain 0.82

-- keep the low pad but darker
xfadeIn 2 16 $ lowPad # gain 0.8 # lpf 700

-- optional: leave a single arp note drifting
-- xfadeIn 4 24 $ degradeBy 0.6 $ arp # gain 0.56
